\ @ID 16
\ @TITLE ANALYTICAL ETUDES
\ @SUBTITLE RADIO -> SYMPHONY · 18 PIECEWISE ETUDES
\ @CATEGORY MATH-SYNTH
\ @PARTS 18
\ @PART 1 Broken Radio I (Nested Sine)
