\ @PART 18 Hyperbolic & Exp Mosaic
\ @SPEED 1.75
\ @REVERB 0.34
\ @FORMULA 18 Analytical Etudes (1:1 synth-engine.js): Radio -> Zimmer -> Aphex Twin -> Mosaic

VARIABLE AE-U   VARIABLE AE-BAR  VARIABLE AE-ST  VARIABLE AE-SF
VARIABLE AE-V1  VARIABLE AE-V2   VARIABLE AE-V3  VARIABLE AE-V4

\ ── Etude 02 tables ──
: AE2-ARP ( bar step -- hz )
  4 IMOD SWAP CASE
    0 OF CASE 0 OF 440.00 ENDOF 1 OF 523.25 ENDOF 2 OF 659.25 ENDOF 493.88 SWAP ENDCASE ENDOF
    1 OF CASE 0 OF 349.23 ENDOF 1 OF 440.00 ENDOF 2 OF 523.25 ENDOF 659.25 SWAP ENDCASE ENDOF
    2 OF CASE 0 OF 523.25 ENDOF 1 OF 659.25 ENDOF 2 OF 783.99 ENDOF 659.25 SWAP ENDCASE ENDOF
    DROP CASE 0 OF 392.00 ENDOF 1 OF 493.88 ENDOF 2 OF 587.33 ENDOF 659.25 SWAP ENDCASE
  0 ENDCASE ;

